  (a converter-mangled "xy-plane"), the label reference "r", and "x-axis"
  outside math mode, unlike the file's own coordinate-tuple math spans and
  the repo's established convention of $x$-axis/$xy$-plane-style wrapping
  for axis and plane names; wrapped each in math mode.
